Notice that <math>AD \parallel PQ</math>, <math>BC \parallel PQ</math>, so <math>AD \parallel BC</math>. Obviously, <math>AD = BC</math>, so <math>ABCD</math> is a parallelogram, we get <cmath>CD = AB = \sqrt{1^2+1^2} = \sqrt{2}.</cmath>

